					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "NEGATIVE RAINBOW\n\nThis example shows how you can create really complex animation with little effort.\nBy offsetting two oscillators, running at different frequencies, we get a very organic animation.\n\nWe use an effect chain in our feedback loop to create the color aberration. Using effects in your feedback loop can create all sorts of weird an special effects. Experimentation is key!"
					}
				},
